<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>财富|财富</title><link>https://fortune.com</link><description>财富 500 强日报和突发商业新闻</description><lastBuildDate>Sun, 23 Aug 2026 00:35:50 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>SpaceX 正在招聘天然气交易以满足能源需求</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/22/spacex-natural-gas-trader-chip-making-rocket-fuel/</link><description>SpaceX 的大型 Starship 火箭使用超冷甲烷（天然气的主要成分）和液氧作为推进剂。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2289079182-e1787441225513.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 22 Aug 2026 23:32:23 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/22/spacex-natural-gas-trader-chip-making-rocket-fuel/</guid></item><item><title>在类似奥运会的赛事中，中国机器人打破了人类创下的运动纪录，其中包括尤塞恩·博尔特的百米冲刺成绩</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/22/chinese-robots-beijing-games-athletic-records-humans-usain-bolt/</link><description>在100米短跑比赛中，仿人机器人取得了9.39秒的成绩，打破了牙买加运动员在2009年创下的9.58秒的人类纪录。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/AP26234518983759.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 22 Aug 2026 23:25:19 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/22/chinese-robots-beijing-games-athletic-records-humans-usain-bolt/</guid></item><item><title>汉克表示，委内瑞拉放弃玻利瓦尔并采用美元将是自欧元出现以来最大的货币转变</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/22/dollarization-venezuela-bolivar-currency-switch-hyperinflation-oil-revenue-debt-steve-hanke/</link><description>“抑制通货膨胀是委内瑞拉恢复稳定的关键，所有其他进展都源于此。” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-1090638304-e1787435106119.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 22 Aug 2026 23:11:10 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/22/dollarization-venezuela-bolivar-currency-switch-hyperinflation-oil-revenue-debt-steve-hanke/</guid></item><item><title>特朗普的股票披露显示 6 月份交易量超过 1,000 笔</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/22/trump-stock-market-trading-disclosure-june-vanguard-etf/</link><description>美国政府道德办公室公布的文件显示，这些交易总额在 7810 万美元至 2.631 亿美元之间。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2291329696-e1787429504201.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 22 Aug 2026 20:15:11 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/22/trump-stock-market-trading-disclosure-june-vanguard-etf/</guid></item><item><title>“当你受到攻击时，你就处于战争状态”——加拿大马克·卡尼指责美国利用经济一体化作为武器，因为贸易战刺激了关税上涨</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/22/us-canada-trade-war-trump-tariffs-mark-carney-economic-integration-weapon/</link><description>美国将对加拿大价值200亿美元的商品加征50%关税，加拿大将9月8日作为报复性惩罚的开始。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/AP26234554217036-e1787432923659.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 22 Aug 2026 21:27:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/22/us-canada-trade-war-trump-tariffs-mark-carney-economic-integration-weapon/</guid></item><item><title>加拿大对卡车关税减免的要求危及贸易谈判</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/22/us-canada-trump-trade-war-trucks-tariff-relief/</link><description>但一位加拿大行业官员表示，是美国人试图分裂该行业。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2287242043-e1787430745617.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 22 Aug 2026 20:37:16 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/22/us-canada-trump-trade-war-trucks-tariff-relief/</guid></item><item><title>Nvidia 客户收到有关 AI 相关价格上涨 15% 以上的通知</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/22/nvidia-customers-ai-related-price-hikes-15-percent-vera-rubin-grace-blackwell-chips/</link><description>价格上涨将对明年初发货的系统生效，并将影响包括采用旗舰产品 Vera Rubin 和 Grace Blackwell 芯片的系统。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2285783561-e1787430174196.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 22 Aug 2026 20:27:38 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/22/nvidia-customers-ai-related-price-hikes-15-percent-vera-rubin-grace-blackwell-chips/</guid></item><item><title>忘掉人工智能吧，债务已经成为华尔街的主角，因为经过多年的警告，市场现在才认为债务已经失控</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/22/debt-tipping-point-bond-yields-treasury-selloff-inflation-dollar/</link><description>“债务什么时候会变得不可持续？当全球金融市场说它是不可持续的时候。这似乎正在发生。” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2281407236-e1787420550291.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 22 Aug 2026 19:25:31 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/22/debt-tipping-point-bond-yields-treasury-selloff-inflation-dollar/</guid></item><item><title>就连亿万富翁也担心他们的 Z 世代孩子无法保住工作，他们的财富顾问表示这种担忧“非常真实”</title><link>https://fortune.com/article/billionaires-worried-gen-z-kids-cant-keep-job/</link><description>财富顾问汤姆·蒂格斯告诉《财富》杂志，对于超级富豪来说，他们的孩子没有为未来做好准备是“非常现实的担忧”。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/GettyImages-1472263927-e1770831995233.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 22 Aug 2026 17:22:57 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/article/billionaires-worried-gen-z-kids-cant-keep-job/</guid></item><item><title>“我们不会忍受”——伊朗最高领导人表示，随着经济在特朗普下一次制裁猛攻之前崩溃，他们已经没有时间了</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/22/iran-economy-crisis-us-naval-blockade-trump-sanctions-dday/</link><description>“作为经历过战争的人，我们懂得和平的真正价值。” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2290828705-e1787413252981.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 22 Aug 2026 17:06:36 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/22/iran-economy-crisis-us-naval-blockade-trump-sanctions-dday/</guid></item></channel></rss>